  <div class="section" id="pricing-policy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head--center">
        <h2>Purchase Notes</h2>
        <p>AI Deep Analysis Pack (¥9.9) terms and scope</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border-soft);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.85rem;">
        <p>1. Product: AI Deep Analysis Pack (¥9.9).</p>
        <p>2. Includes: 1 deep report + up to 3 follow-up questions within 48 hours.</p>
        <p>3. Effective time: starts immediately after successful payment.</p>
        <p>4. Scope: AI analysis only, no 1:1 human consultation included.</p>
        <p>5. Validity: after 48 hours or question limit reached, purchase again or upgrade.</p>
        <p>6. Refund note: once virtual content is unlocked and used, no unconditional refund.</p>
        <p>7. Risk notice: results are for reference and not medical, legal, or investment advice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:14px;background:#faf8f2;border:1px solid var(--border-soft);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.85rem;">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--text);font-size:1rem;">Quick FAQ</h4>
        <p><strong>Q1: Is ¥9.9 charged per question?</strong><br>No, it is a fixed pack with fixed rights.</p>
        <p><strong>Q2: Is this a lifetime membership?</strong><br>No, it is a one-time unlock pack.</p>
        <p><strong>Q3: How is it different from 1:1 consultation?</strong><br>¥9.9 is AI-only. 1:1 expert consultation is a separate paid service.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

